  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界箱子</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">添加了一种高容量的下界主题箱子，让你能在单个容器中存储多得多的物品。🔥 这是为想要减少管理箱子时间、多花时间玩游戏的玩家准备的简单存储升级。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组拥有54格空间，默认支持比普通堆叠大8倍的堆叠尺寸，可以在一个惊人的小空间内存储海量资源。📦 它非常适合农场、矿洞探险以及大型存储室，这些地方的原版容器很快就会变得杂乱。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为了让人感觉在下界中自然而然，这个箱子配备了合适的视觉效果和交互，同时保持可配置性以适应不同的游戏风格。⚙️</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高容量存储：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在54个格子中存储物品，每个格子可容纳比正常大得多的堆叠。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">8倍堆叠尺寸：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过在相同空间中容纳更多物品，大大减少了箱子杂乱。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界主题设计：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">具有与下界进度自然契合的视觉、声音、粒子和交互。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可配置容量：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">调整存储相关设置，更好地适应你偏好的游戏体验。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端和服务端均需安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric和NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持，可以在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（需要安装</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组菜单</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作，需在Fabric上安装）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件均位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">中，命名格式为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型都可能存在于某个模组中，甚至可能根本没有。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cadaverous_queen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">cadaverous_queen</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以其旧的</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界箱子</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组提供的原始创意。箱子纹理已从原版模组中复用。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢来自Discord的</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">TyIer#8369</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为箱子界面的灵感。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaves-be-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armorstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-tridents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/climate-rivers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effect-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantmentinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
